flowchart TD
  E[Write evals: measure the baseline] --> P[Improve the prompt<br/>and add examples]
  P --> K{Still wrong because<br/>the model lacks facts?}
  K -->|yes| R[Add retrieval: RAG]
  K -->|no| B{Wrong behaviour:<br/>format, style, judgement?}
  R --> B
  B -->|no| S[Ship it and keep measuring]
  B -->|yes| C{Stable task, hundreds of good<br/>examples, volume that pays back?}
  C -->|no| P
  C -->|yes| F[Fine-tune, on top of RAG if needed]
  F --> E
